    "detailed_description": "John Fox is an elite warrior and super soldier who saved the leaders of various States. He was a professional mercenary who retired with honor. <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/f31a3dfc61680468da0ece73cf4a1654.poster.avif?t=1740700536\" width=454 height=246 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/f31a3dfc61680468da0ece73cf4a1654.webm?t=1740700536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/f31a3dfc61680468da0ece73cf4a1654.mp4?t=1740700536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>But the evil big toad, decided to make an army of John Fox clones. <br>To lure the protagonist into the lab. The big toad's minions kill Milo, John's pet. <br>John Fox rushes in pursuit of the harmful toad and encounters an army of clone frogs, which flooded the entire city. <br><br>If the big toad manages to defeat John Fox, the world will be doomed to misery and chaos.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/2293c9e7874b44a7fdaf28fa99cedf3b.poster.avif?t=1740700536\" width=486 height=274 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/2293c9e7874b44a7fdaf28fa99cedf3b.webm?t=1740700536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/2293c9e7874b44a7fdaf28fa99cedf3b.mp4?t=1740700536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Features:<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>2D Pixel Beat 'em up<br></li><li>Variety of terrains and scenarios<br></li><li>Motorbike chases<br></li><li>Thrilling music<br></li><li>Boss battles</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/3cc0a8fd0850278694ba6c6cd6772e20.poster.avif?t=1740700536\" width=512 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/3cc0a8fd0850278694ba6c6cd6772e20.webm?t=1740700536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2859080/extras/3cc0a8fd0850278694ba6c6cd6772e20.mp4?t=1740700536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>",
